        ns1:page 1 ;
        ns1:text "Synthetic replay for ST01_FILLING, incident INC-ST01-20261024-01, order PO-1001. Selected time: 2026-10-24T13:00:05+02:00. This source provides observations, not repair or restart approval. {\"event_id\": \"EVT-ST01-001-A\", \"alarm_instance_id\": \"ALM-ST01-20261024-01\", \"alarm_code\": \"FILL-PRS-LO\", \"sensor_id\": \"ST01_FILLING_PRS\", \"occurred_at\": \"2026-10-24T12:40:00+02:00\", \"transition\": \"activated\", \"severity\": \"warning\", \"trigger_sample_id\": \"TEL-ST01-002\", \"trigger_value\": 3.2, \"unit\": \"bar\", \"controller_action\": \"warning_notification\"} Active at selected time: True. Controller action is a request; confirm machine state using telemetry. The cause is unconfirmed; no repair or restart release is recorded." .

